{"id":"820236a9d2","t":"Raised by Villains","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Raised-by-Villains.jpg","n":163,"l":163,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"raised-by-villains"},"u":1795038309822,"desc":"ظننت أنني طفل غير شرعي؟ بعد عام من أن أصبحت لاعبًا إضافيًا ، اكتشفت أنني على وشك الطرد. قلت إنني أفضل مغادرة المنزل بمفردي. “في الواقع ، هذه ابنتي. حق يا ابنتي؟ لفتت عيون عيني اللورد مختل عقليا. “سمعت أن الأموال التي أعطيتها للشخص الآخر بعد اللعب كانت كافية لشراء جزيرة.” عملت كبنت لأنني كنت سأحصل على ثروة إذا خرجت معه ، وبعد بضعة أشهر ، كنت سأغادر المنزل بحساب مصرفي سميك. “ابق معي حتى أخبرك بالمغادرة.” بالمناسبة ، والدي ، الذي اعتبرني لعبة ، يأتي إلي ويمسك بي.","type":"مانهوا كورية","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","فنتازيا","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"raised-by-villains"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/1/"},"2":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/2/"},"3":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/3/"},"4":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/4/"},"5":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/5/"},"6":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/6/"},"7":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/7/"},"8":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/8/"},"9":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/9/"},"10":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/10/"},"11":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/11/"},"12":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/12/"},"13":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/13/"},"14":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/14/"},"15":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/15/"},"16":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/16/"},"17":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/17/"},"18":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/18/"},"19":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/raised-by-villains/19/"},"20":{"ml":"raised-by-villains|/manga/